---
// Component: Problem vs Solution - Why Raw Agents Fail vs Deterministic Guardrails
---

<section
  id="problem-solution"
  data-testid="problem-solution-section"
  class="space-y-6 scroll-mt-20"
>
  <!-- Section Header -->
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-3 border-b border-obsidian-700 pb-4">
    <div>
      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-accent flex items-center space-x-2">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-amber-glow"></span>
        <span class="uppercase tracking-widest" data-i18n="problemSolution.tag">ANALYSIS // PROBLEM VS SOLUTION</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-100 uppercase font-mono mt-1 tracking-wide" data-i18n="problemSolution.title">
        Why Raw Agents Fail — And How Gantry Fixes It
      </h2>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono max-w-lg" data-i18n="problemSolution.subtitle">
      Prose instructions in prompts are probabilistic. Gantry replaces wishful prompting with deterministic code, adversarial checks, and operator approval.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Core Thesis Industrial Banner -->
  <div
    data-testid="core-thesis-banner"
    class="border-l-4 border-l-amber-glow border border-obsidian-700 bg-obsidian-950 p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono"
  >
    <div class="space-y-1">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-amber-glow text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>◆</span>
        <span data-i18n="problemSolution.thesisTag">FIRST PRINCIPLE // ADR-0004 & PRD §2</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-100 font-bold" data-i18n="problemSolution.thesisQuote">
        "Agents + code > agents alone."
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl" data-i18n="problemSolution.thesisDesc">
        Every decision that must not be improvised — what is ready, what must be proven, whether quality gates pass, and when an Issue is done — is made by a workflow script. Agents propose; scripts verify; the operator retains final approval.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-shrink-0 flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1.5 bg-obsidian-850 border border-obsidian-700 text-xs text-slate-300">
      <span class="text-amber-glow font-bold" data-i18n="problemSolution.thesisAuthorityLabel">AUTHORITY:</span>
      <span class="text-slate-200" data-i18n="problemSolution.thesisAuthorityVal">SCRIPTS DECIDE</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Structured Comparison Cards Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 font-mono">
    <!-- Card 1: Context Degradation & Bloat -->
    <div
      data-testid="problem-card-context"
      class="border border-obsidian-700 bg-obsidian-900/90 p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 hover:border-obsidian-600 transition-colors relative overflow-hidden group"
    >
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-obsidian-800 pb-2.5">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-red-400 bg-red-950/50 border border-red-800/60 px-2 py-0.5" data-i18n="problemSolution.pitfall1Tag">
            FAILURE MODE 01 // PITFALL
          </span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase" data-i18n="problemSolution.pitfall1Category">STATE DRIFT</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-100 uppercase tracking-wide" data-i18n="problemSolution.pitfall1Title">
            Context Degradation & Hallucination
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="problemSolution.pitfall1Desc">
            Long-running agent chat sessions accumulate tokens, lose instruction precision, drop critical constraints, and hallucinate missing architecture.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Gantry Guardrail Resolution -->
      <div class="border-t border-obsidian-800 pt-3 bg-obsidian-950/70 -mx-5 sm:-mx-6 -mb-5 sm:-mb-6 p-4 border-l-2 border-l-emerald-500">
        <div class="text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center space-x-1.5 mb-1">
          <span>✓</span>
          <span data-i18n="problemSolution.gantry1Title">GANTRY PRINCIPLE: Bounded Context & Fresh Agents</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="problemSolution.gantry1Desc">
          Preflight validates tokens with budget.py (refuting packages > 15% window). Every phase (Implementer, Reviewer, Critic) spawns a fresh subagent with zero memory pollution.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: Mock Escapes & Test Tampering -->
    <div
      data-testid="problem-card-mocks"
      class="border border-obsidian-700 bg-obsidian-900/90 p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 hover:border-obsidian-600 transition-colors relative overflow-hidden group"
    >
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-obsidian-800 pb-2.5">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-red-400 bg-red-950/50 border border-red-800/60 px-2 py-0.5" data-i18n="problemSolution.pitfall2Tag">
            FAILURE MODE 02 // PITFALL
          </span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase" data-i18n="problemSolution.pitfall2Category">TEST CORROSION</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-100 uppercase tracking-wide" data-i18n="problemSolution.pitfall2Title">
            Mock Escapes & Test Tampering
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="problemSolution.pitfall2Desc">
            When code fails, agents casually mock out complex modules, weaken assertions, delete failing tests, or claim victory on untested stubs.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Gantry Guardrail Resolution -->
      <div class="border-t border-obsidian-800 pt-3 bg-obsidian-950/70 -mx-5 sm:-mx-6 -mb-5 sm:-mb-6 p-4 border-l-2 border-l-emerald-500">
        <div class="text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center space-x-1.5 mb-1">
          <span>✓</span>
          <span data-i18n="problemSolution.gantry2Title">GANTRY PRINCIPLE: Untrusted Implementer & Adversarial Critic</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="problemSolution.gantry2Desc">
          Implementers are treated as untrusted code producers. Only an independent Adversarial Critic with a separate context can accept delivery by attempting to refute claims.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3: Unearned Self-Approval -->
    <div
      data-testid="problem-card-approval"
      class="border border-obsidian-700 bg-obsidian-900/90 p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 hover:border-obsidian-600 transition-colors relative overflow-hidden group"
    >
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-obsidian-800 pb-2.5">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-red-400 bg-red-950/50 border border-red-800/60 px-2 py-0.5" data-i18n="problemSolution.pitfall3Tag">
            FAILURE MODE 03 // PITFALL
          </span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase" data-i18n="problemSolution.pitfall3Category">UNEARNED TRUST</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-100 uppercase tracking-wide" data-i18n="problemSolution.pitfall3Title">
            Wishful Self-Approval & Premature Done
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="problemSolution.pitfall3Desc">
            Agents conclude tasks with "Everything looks great!" without executing tests, ignoring unhandled edge cases, and marking incomplete items done.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Gantry Guardrail Resolution -->
      <div class="border-t border-obsidian-800 pt-3 bg-obsidian-950/70 -mx-5 sm:-mx-6 -mb-5 sm:-mb-6 p-4 border-l-2 border-l-emerald-500">
        <div class="text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center space-x-1.5 mb-1">
          <span>✓</span>
          <span data-i18n="problemSolution.gantry3Title">GANTRY PRINCIPLE: Deterministic Scripts & Gate Verification</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="problemSolution.gantry3Desc">
          Zero self-approval: roadmap.py done is the sole authority to mark issues complete, guarded by differential quality gates (RFC 6901 mappings) and clean test exits.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 4: Flaky Merges & Branch Drifts -->
    <div
      data-testid="problem-card-drift"
      class="border border-obsidian-700 bg-obsidian-900/90 p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 hover:border-obsidian-600 transition-colors relative overflow-hidden group"
    >
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-obsidian-800 pb-2.5">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-red-400 bg-red-950/50 border border-red-800/60 px-2 py-0.5" data-i18n="problemSolution.pitfall4Tag">
            FAILURE MODE 04 // PITFALL
          </span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase" data-i18n="problemSolution.pitfall4Category">MERGE CONFLICTS</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-100 uppercase tracking-wide" data-i18n="problemSolution.pitfall4Title">
            Big-Bang Divergence & Integration Hell
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="problemSolution.pitfall4Desc">
            Agents attempt massive multi-file refactors simultaneously, resulting in catastrophic merge conflicts, broken builds, and untraceable regressions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Gantry Guardrail Resolution -->
      <div class="border-t border-obsidian-800 pt-3 bg-obsidian-950/70 -mx-5 sm:-mx-6 -mb-5 sm:-mb-6 p-4 border-l-2 border-l-emerald-500">
        <div class="text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center space-x-1.5 mb-1">
          <span>✓</span>
          <span data-i18n="problemSolution.gantry4Title">GANTRY PRINCIPLE: Serial Wave Integration & Isolated Worktrees</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="problemSolution.gantry4Desc">
          frontier.py computes DAG execution waves. Accepted slices merge serially, running differential quality gates (gates.py) after every merge.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
